    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/web-csrf-state-change.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:56c9848740208985c20937492fc163c9319903af6156a5b6bcb138bfb754d74a",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "CSRF：利用已认证会话",
      "section": [
        "CSRF：利用已认证会话",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 找状态变更端点（改密、加管理员、转账），确认参数可预测。\n2. 检查 token/Referer/Origin/SameSite 校验；尝试去掉 token 或复用。\n3. 构造跨站表单/请求，在已登录会话中触发。\n4. 从服务端状态变化确认效果（而不是只看响应码）。",
      "line_start": 16,
      "line_end": 19,
      "truncated": false
    },
